WEBVTT

00:03:58.567 --> 00:04:00.403
they reaffirm their social ties

00:04:00.403 --> 00:04:03.990
and they reaffirm a shared
worldview through rituals,

00:04:04.031 --> 00:04:05.449
not through dancing,

00:04:05.449 --> 00:04:08.828
but through hanging out by the bar
and having PowerPoints.

00:04:08.869 --> 00:04:09.996
Same function.

00:04:10.037 --> 00:04:11.831
(Laughter)

00:04:11.872 --> 00:04:14.041
But I did that in the world
of high finance.

00:04:14.458 --> 00:04:16.585
But what I want to make you
think about today

00:04:16.585 --> 00:04:19.672
is that you don't have to be using
these tools in Tajikistan

00:04:19.714 --> 00:04:21.924
or Tokyo or Wall Street.

00:04:21.924 --> 00:04:26.595
You can actually use them
to look around your own world today.

00:04:27.179 --> 00:04:28.639
Your everyday life.

00:04:29.473 --> 00:04:31.267
You can use them to look at something